radv/directmesh: the PS5 and PS5 Slim

Their GPU (Oberon, 1002:13fb) is in the BC-250's chip family, CHIP_GFX1013, which DirectMesh supports; only its
PCI id is missing from the list DirectMesh turns itself on for.
---
diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_directmesh.h b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_directmesh.h
index faf3e74..e12cd9d 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_directmesh.h
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_directmesh.h
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ radv_directmesh_pci(uint16_t vendor, uint16_t device)
    if (vendor != 0x1002)
       return false;
    switch (device) {
+   case 0x13fb: /* PS5 and PS5 Slim (Oberon) */
    case 0x13fe:
    case 0x143f:
    case 0x7310: case 0x7312: case 0x7318: case 0x7319:
